      "img": "icons/svg/aura.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>An otyugh’s bite carries a nasty disease called filth fever. Filth fever—bite: Fortitude save (DC 16) negates; incubation period 1d3 days; initial and secondary damage 1d3 Dex and 1d3 Con.</p>",
